{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "אחרי מות", :translit "acharei mot", :gloss "after the death of"} {:he "ולאיש אשר ישכב עם טמאה", :translit "v'la'ish asher yishkav im t'me'ah", :gloss "and to a man who lies with a menstruating woman"} {:he "אחרי מות", :translit "acharei mot", :gloss "after the death of"} {:he "המשמש עם הטהורה ופירסה נדה תחתיו", :translit "ha'm'shammesh im ha't'horah v'firsah niddah tachatav", :gloss "one who engages in relations with a pure woman and a menstruant spread beneath him"} {:he "לא יפרוש באבר חי", :translit "lo yifrosh b'eber chai", :gloss "he must not withdraw while the organ is alive"} {:he "אלא ימתין עד שימות האבר ויפרוש", :translit "ela yachsper ad sheyamut ha'eber v'yifrosh", :gloss "but must wait until the organ dies and then withdraw"} {:he "זאת תורת", :translit "zot torat", :gloss "this is the law of"} {:he "אחרי מות", :translit "acharei mot", :gloss "after the death of"} {:he "מתו על שהורו הלכה בפני רבן", :translit "metu al shehoru halakhah b'fanai rabban", :gloss "they died for issuing a halakhic ruling in the presence of their teacher"} {:he "משכני אשר בתוכם", :translit "mishkani asher b'tocham", :gloss "My Tabernacle that is among them"} {:he "אחרי מות", :translit "acharei mot", :gloss "after the death of"} {:he "בקרובי אקדש", :translit "b'krovai ekadeish", :gloss "through those near Me I will be sanctified"} {:he "נדה תשב ז' ימים קודם שתטהר", :translit "niddah taishev shiv'at yamim kodem shetit'harer", :gloss "the menstruant sits seven days before she purifies"} {:he "מפרישין הכהן ז' ימים קודם שיכנס לפנים", :translit "mafrishin ha'kohen shiv'at yamim kodem sheyichnas lifnim", :gloss "they separate the priest seven days before he enters inside"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "Semikhah: juxtaposition of adjacent verses — 'and to a man who lies with a menstruating woman' (Lev 15:33) is immediately followed by 'after the death' (Lev 16:1)"} {:kind :other, :note "Semikhah: 'this is the law of' (Lev 15:32) is adjacent to 'after the death' (Lev 16:1)"} {:kind :other, :note "Semikhah: 'My Tabernacle that is among them' (Exod 25:8 context) linked to 'after the death' (Lev 16:1)"} {:kind :other, :note "Gezeirah shavah: juxtaposition of portion of Yom HaKippurim to portion of the menstruant, both requiring seven days"}], :frame {:text "The prohibition against withdrawing during relations when a menstruant is spread beneath is addressed in Niddah 21a. The death of Nadav and Avihu for issuing a halakhic ruling in the presence of their teacher Moshe is recorded at Eruvin 63a. The verse 'through those near Me I will be sanctified' (Lev 10:3) is interpreted at Torat Kohanim (Shemini, Mechilta d'Miluim 1) as referring to the death of Nadav and Avihu. The seven-day separation of the high priest before Yom HaKippurim is taught at Yoma 2a.", :sources ["Niddah 21a" "Eruvin 63a" "Leviticus 10:3" "Torat Kohanim Shemini 1" "Yoma 2a"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :other, :note "Semikhah: juxtaposition of adjacent verses — 'and to a man who lies with a menstruating woman' (Lev 15:33) is immediately followed by 'after the death' (Lev 16:1)", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Semikhah: 'this is the law of' (Lev 15:32) is adjacent to 'after the death' (Lev 16:1)", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Semikhah: 'My Tabernacle that is among them' (Exod 25:8 context) linked to 'after the death' (Lev 16:1)", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Gezeirah shavah: juxtaposition of portion of Yom HaKippurim to portion of the menstruant, both requiring seven days", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:24:05.690187293Z", :model "glm-5.2"}